  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the development of a financial account to further introduce System of National Accounts 2008</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the Project is to support the current efforts of the Government of Turkmenistan in strengthening the statistical capacity of the State Committee of Turkmenistan on Statistics (TurkmenStat), as well as improving the quality of statistical data that will contribute to a more detailed assessment and monitoring of economic, monetary and financial developments in the economy.</narrative>
  </description>
